// Branch coverage for webrtc: the package's own tests, and nothing else.
//
//   deno task coverage:webrtc
//   deno task coverage:webrtc --verbose
//
// The ninth of the packages `issues/system/0205` records as unmeasured, and the third and last
// consumer of `packages/tls/src/handshake.wac` — after `packages/tls` itself and `packages/quic`.
// `issues/system/0241b` is about what those two measurements did not add up to; this is the third
// term.
//
// None of the 76 tests expects a trap.

